  "提示：--wake-on-open 已经不需要了，默认就会按匹配度和名次领取任务池里的任务；这次按 --claim always 处理。": "Note: --wake-on-open is no longer needed; tasks in the pool are claimed by match score and rank by default. Treating this as --claim always.",
  "--claim 只能是 smart、always 或 off": "--claim must be smart, always or off",
