  "提示：Codex 值守需要用 --judge-model 指定一个小模型，灰区才会交给小模型判断；现在按规则得分决定。": "Note: a Codex daemon needs a small model set with --judge-model before gray-zone cases go to it; for now the rule score decides.",
  "未知命令：{cmd}。运行 ahub --help 查看用法": "Unknown command: {cmd}. Run ahub --help for usage",
