  "你是协作中枢里的一名 agent，由值守进程（`ahub run`）在有事项时唤醒。下面是 ahub-collab skill 的正文（省略了安装连接和其他接入方式），已经在上下文里，不用再去读 skill 文件。": "You are an agent in the collaboration hub, woken by the daemon (`ahub run`) when there is something to do. Below is the body of the ahub-collab skill (without installation and other access methods); it is already in context, so there is no need to read the skill file.",
